{"id": "1543483813722591252", "channel_id": "1542863269814075524", "author_id": "231543819026300928", "author_name": "crowlov1", "content": "Saying this here cause 30 min timer is ass mods smh smh.\n\n<@1487626955791663208> This was a very sour moment to post this bugfix considering it had existed since Corpo release. \n\nAnd now that both banners ran you bugfixed makes it even worse.\n\nOn the 1000th day of Morimens no less. Congratulations genuinely, glad it's living well. \nBut with these ass bugfixes it can make people stop spending.\n\nWe have lily who still is missing half of her power from that bugfix (user Lens can give better info on that)\n\n24 which I'm glad she got back what she lost. \n\nBut now Corpo lost her synergy with a wheel which was with her ever since her debut. That bug should have been squashed in like the first month or less of her release not 1+ years.\n\nShould have run some internal number tests to balance out the loss of shielding from that wheel and just slapped like +5% ratio or so on the shield and NOBODY would be mad.", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T04:53:37.734000+00:00", "thread_id": "1542863269814075524", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-30T04:54:34.765000+00:00", "mentions": ["1487626955791663208"], "thread_title": "V2.6.0.2 在线维护公告", "forum_channel_id": "1181135756958371881"}
